umors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  19 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 08 16     HER 2 Addendum     RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR HER 2 c erb REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Breast  Right   The tumor cells do not show overexpression of HER 2 c erb 2  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  23 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 12 22 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm portion of fibroadipose tissue with a localizing wire  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a yellow white cut surface as well as a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm firm  poorly defined nodule abutting the inked margin  A representative section from the nodule is frozen as FX 1 and is saved frozen  The rest of the specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes A G with the remainder of the nodule in cassettes A B  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  TAN A  INCE  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST MASS  RIGHT   IN SITU AND INVASIVE CARCINOMA  AWAIT PERMANENTS  O R  Resident  RUBEN D  CARRASCO  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Nancy Lee Harris  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Pathologic_size.
