d firm  tan white cut surface  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral aspect of resection cavity to superior and inferior margins  one section    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   One cross section of the resection cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional section through resection cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Remainder of resection cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibrous area deep to nipple   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Right upper quadrant lymph nodes  two  one blue inked and bisected  Received fresh  labeled  left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm simple mastectomy specimen with a stitch designating 6 o clock and a REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm portion of skin present anteriorly and containing the nipple  The anterior soft tissue surface consists of unremarkable fibrofatty breast tissue and the posterior resection surface consists of unremarkable breast tissue and thin fascia  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal primarily adipose breast parenchyma with an area of primarily fibrous tissue inferiorly  The fibrous area around the nipple also contains focal brown cystic nodules up to 0 2cm  There is also a fairly discrete REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm fibrous area in the left lateral superior portion of the specimen  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous areas in left lateral superior quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibrous area in left lateral inferior quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative fibrous area in inferior portion of specimen   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section from medial inferior quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section deep to nipple   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of medial portion of specimen  Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE Addendum  1  An immunohistochemical stain for e cadherin  performed on slide A 10 confirms the diagnosis of lobular neoplasia  lobular carcinoma in situ  in this section  Addendum  1 by Ronald Balassanian M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY  report_end  , Pathologic.
