TE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm firm  tan white mass that abuts the margin  The specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes B J  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast final shaved margins superior  is a non oriented piece of white tan tissue and attached adipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  The specimen is bisected and submitted entirely in cassette K  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast final shaved margins medial  are 2 pieces of tan white soft tissue the first measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  the second measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  There are sutures denoting the area furthest from the tumor  and each of these is inked black  The smaller of the two tissue fragments is serially sectioned along its long axis and submitted entirely in cassette L  The larger tissue fragment is serially sectioned and submitted entirely in cassettes M N  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast final shaved margins lateral  is a non oriented piece of soft yellow tissue  No firm areas are grossly noted  The specimen is bivalved and submitted entirely in cassette O  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast final shaved margins inferior  is an irregularly shaped piece of tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  A suture denotes the point furthest from the tumor and the side is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned and submitted entirely in cassettes P Q  Resident  JOSHUA B  KISH  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE LEFT AXILLA SENTINEL  EXCISION PART B  BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  BREAST LEFT SUPERIOR FINAL