ight axillary sentinel node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm tan yellow nodular soft tissue which is trisected and submitted in cassettes P R  Resident  CHRISTOPHER M  WILLIAM  MD   Ph D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA  SENTINEL   BIOPSY , Pathologic_size.
