sue  several areas of palpable firmness  One of these measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  and comes to within 0 2cm of the nearest margin  anterior   There is a second area of ill defined firm grittiness  beneath the skin ellipse  and coming to within 1 0cm of the nearest margin  anterior   These later sections are in H through J respectively  Further sections are submitted from medial to lateral in K through Q  Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Pathologic_size.
