cision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  11 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 15 55     HER 2 Addendum     RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Right  block P   HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 to chromosome 17 signals in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates HER 2 neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  17 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 15 26 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast modified radical mastectomy   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm modified radical mastectomy specimen with an overlying skin ellipse  measuring REMOVED_DATE x 8 0cm  The skin ellipse has a centrally located unremarkable nipple areolar complex  In addition  there is an attached axillary tail  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm  The anterior resection margin is inked blue and the posterior resection margin is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a mostly unremarkable yellow lobulated cut surface  There is one ill defined firm tan area near the inferior portion of the specimen  This area measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm and is 4 0cm from the posterior resection margin  Four represenative sections of the firm area are submitted from lateral to medial in cassettes A D  Additional representative sections of this area are submitted in K P  A representative section of grossly uninvolved breast  lateral to the firm area is submitted in cassette E  A representative section of posterior margin is submitted in cassette F  Multiple axillary lymph nodes are dissected out  the largest measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  The lymph nodes are submitted as follows  G  Largest lymph node  bisected  