 fatty tissue without other focal lesions  Representative tissue is submitted as follows  Section code  A  Mass  1 and mass  2 to posterior margin  B C  Remainder of mass  1  D E  Remainder of mass  2  F G  Uninvolved parenchyma  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast posterior margin  is an irregular portion of yellow fibrofatty soft tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm in greatest dimensions  The specimen is oriented with a suture designating the surface of the tissue which was furthest from the tumor  The sutured surface  surface furthest from tumor  is inked black  The opposite surface  surface closest to tumor  is inked blue  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal an unremarkable cut surface without focal lesions  The tissue is submitted entirely as cassettes H O  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast final shaved margin  are multiple irregular fragments of yellow fibrofatty soft tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm in aggregate  Sectioning reveals an unremarkable fatty cut surface without focal lesions  The tissue is submitted entirely as cassettes P T  Resident  JOHN BRANDA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  LEFT  POSTERIOR MARGIN   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT  FINAL SHAVED MARGIN   EXCISION , Pathologic_size.
