laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  04 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 07 14 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the frozen section lab  labelled with the patients name  unit number and   Right breast lump   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE X 3 0cm piece of breast tissue  The specimen was inked superior margin black  deep margin black  inferior margin blue  lateral margin red  medial margin yellow  anterior margin green  Sectioning reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm well defined stellate tan to white firm mass  coming within 0 2cm of the closest inferior margin  Section through the tumor including the closest inferior margin are submitted from medial to lateral in cassette A  B and C  Representative section away from the tumor are submitted in cassettes D and E  Received fresh  labelled with the patients name  unit number and  Right breast deep inferior margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm soft  yellow white piece of breast with a suture marking the margin farthest from the tumor  The furthest margin is inked black  the opposite side of the specimen is inked green  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassette F   I  Received fresh  labelled with the patients name  unit number and  Right axillary content  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm soft  white yellow piece of adipose tissue  Lymph nodes are dissected and submitted in cassettes J   M  Resident  RUBEN D  CARRASCO  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  RIGHT  EXCISION  TUMOR CLOSE TO INTERNAL DEEP MARGIN  O R  Resident  SAHA SADEGHI  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Nancy Lee Harris  M D                                 