arkable parenchymal area  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axillary node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm portion of adipose tissue  from which multiple lymph nodes are identified  ranging from 0 5cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm  A representative section from each lymph node is submitted in Cassettes F L  Note that representative sections of the largest lymph node is bisected and submitted entirely in cassettes K L  Resident  SAMANTHA J  PULLIAM  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Rosa Sung Eun Choi  M D  David L Berger  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   LUMPECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Pathologic.
