f tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  THE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR PROGESTERONE RECEPTOR PROTEIN ARE FOR INVESTIGATIONAL USE ONLY  THEY MUST NOT BE USED FOR CLINICAL PURPOSES  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  27 REMOVED_MONTH 93 at 10 18 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  Left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm rubbery nodule  The specimen is inked and sectioned  revealing a well defined  tan white lesion measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  that approaches to within 0 2cm of a margin  A representative section is frozen as Frozen Section  1 and saved frozen  An additional is sent for receptors  The remainder is submitted entirely in A through E  Resident  Michael Pins  M D      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LEFT BREAST   INFILTRATING DIATAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Jay Austen  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Volker Nickeleit  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Leslie Wayne Ottinger  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST   report_end  , Pathologic_size.
